    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this crazy sinus infection like my head is throbbing and i cant breathe thru my nose. i have high blood pressure though and my doctor has me on lisinopril, is it okay if i take some sudafed to help clear it up? would that mess anything up?",
      "source": "evaluator"
