      "content": "No, you should not take Sudafed while on lisinopril because it contains pseudoephedrine, which can raise your blood pressure and cause serious interactions with your medication. Since sinus infections combined with high blood pressure require careful management, please consult your doctor or pharmacist immediately before taking any over-the-counter cold medicine. They may suggest a safer alternative like a saline rinse or a specific nasal steroid that won't interfere with your condition.",
